 <section style="background:var(--navy)"><div class="wrap" style="text-align:center;padding:3rem 1.5rem"><h2 style="font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.9rem;color:var(--ivory);margin-bottom:.8rem">Get an itemized South Carolina closing cost sheet.</h2><p style="color:rgba(244,239,232,.6);max-width:600px;margin:0 auto 1.6rem;line-height:1.7">Because our affiliated lender, BrickWood Mortgage, a separate company, works with us daily, one conversation gets you an actual itemized cost sheet for a specific address and loan, escrowed at the right tax rate from day one.</p><div style="display:flex;gap:.75rem;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap"><a class="btn btn-primary" href="/contact/">Get my cost sheet</a><a href="/buyers/programs/" style="font-family:var(--sans);font-weight:600;font-size:.9rem;color:var(--brass-2);text-decoration:none;align-self:center">Down payment assistance →</a></div></div></section>
 
