ss, and local news reported the groundbreaking in February 2026. In September 2025, MUSC Health and Tidelands Health said plans for a 36-bed hospital at SC-31 and SC-707 remained underway.</p></div><div style="border-top:1px solid var(--rule);padding:1.4rem 0"><h3 style="font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.2rem;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:.5rem">What awards and certifications do Myrtle Beach hospitals hold?</h3><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.7;max-width:680px">Healthgrades placed Grand Strand Medical Center among America’s 250 Best Hospitals in 2023 and 2024, and among America’s 100 Best for stroke care and critical care from 2023 through 2025. Tidelands Waccamaw and Tidelands Georgetown are Joint Commission-certified advanced primary stroke centers. Conway Medical Center runs an accredited family medicine residency sponsored by Campbell University.</p></div><div style="border-top:1px solid var(--rule);padding:1.4rem 0"><h3 style="font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.2rem;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:.5rem">Is there a VA hospital in Myrtle Beach?</h3><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.7;max-width:680px">There is a VA outpatient clinic at 1800 Airpark Drive in Myrtle Beach, part of VA Charleston Health Care, offering primary care, mental health, geriatrics, laboratory, imaging and telehealth. The nearest full VA medical center is the Ralph H. Johnson VA Medical Center at 109 Bee Street in Charleston.</p></div><div style="border-top:1px solid var(--rule);padding:1.4rem 0"><h3 style="font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.2rem;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:.5rem">Does where I buy change how far I am from a hospital?</h3><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.7;max-width:680px">Yes, and it is worth checking before you choose an area. For houses in six towns, the middle drive to the nearest of five main hospitals is 6 to 13 minutes with no traffic, by our measurement. The hospitals sit at Myrtle Beach, Carolina Forest, Conway, Little River, Murrells Inlet, Loris and Georgetown, with free-standing emergency rooms between them. Ask us for the drive from any specific address you are considering.</p></div><div style="border-top:1px solid var(--rule);margin-top:2.2rem;padding-top:1.5rem;max-width:720px"><p style="font-family:var(--sans);font-size:.7rem;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--brass);margin-bottom:.5rem;font-weight:600">Who wrote this</p><p style="font-family:var(--sans);font-size:.78rem;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.6;max-width:720px">Chapter 3 Realty is a real estate brokerage in Myrtle Beach, built as a partnership around a simple idea: you should be as informed as possible on the biggest purchase of your life, every single time. Tim Nash is the Broker-in-Charge, South Carolina broker license 43182, with more than 30 years selling real estate on the Grand Strand. He reviews every page we publish and runs our market analyzes himself. His father, Fred Nash, also sold real estate here, and Fred Nash Boulevard by Myrtle Beach International Airport is named for him. Devin Day wrote this page. He is our Operations Officer and a relocator himself, from Ohio. Meet the team on <a href="/about/" style="color:var(--brass);font-weight:600;text-decoration:none">the about page</a> or read <a href="/why-chapter-3/" style="color:var(--brass);font-weight:600;text-decoration:none">why buyers work with us</a>. The direct line is <a href="tel:+18543332135" style="color:var(--brass);font-weight:600;text-decoration:none">854.333.2135</a>.</p></div><p style="font-family:var(--sans);font-size:.78rem;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.6;max-width:720px;margin-top:1.6rem"><strong style="color:var(--navy)">Sources:</strong> <a href="https://www.mygrandstrandhealth.com/about" style="color:var(--brass);font-weight:600;text-decoration:none" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Grand Strand Health</a>, <a href="https://www.conwaymedicalcenter.com/about/" style="color:var(--brass);font-weight:600;text-decoration:none" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Conway Medical Center</a>, <a href="https://www.mcleodhealth.org/locations/mcleod-seacoast/" style="color:var(--brass);font-weight:600;text-decoration:none" rel="noopener" target="_blank">McLeod Health</a>, <a href="https://www.mcleodhealth.org/news-entry/mcleod-health-carolina-forest-hospital-now-open/" style="color:var(--brass);font-weight:600;text-decoration:none" rel="noopener" target="_blank">McLeod Health Carolina Forest, now open</a>, <a href="https://www.tidelandshealth.org/locations/hospitals/" style="color:var(--brass);font-weight:600;text-decoration:none" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Tidelands Health</a>, <a href="https://www.va.gov/charleston-health-care/locations/myrtle-beach-va-clinic/" style="color:var(--brass);font-weight:600;text-decoration:none" rel="noopener" target="_blank">VA Charleston Health Care</a>. Bed counts, designations and awards are as published by each system or awarding body and were current in August 2026. The three new hospitals are from the <a href="https://dph.sc.gov/sites/scdph/files/Library/00607-ENG-CR.pdf" style="color:var(--brass);font-weight:600;text-decoration:none" rel="noopener" target="_blank">2026 South Carolina State Health Plan</a>; South Strand Hospital&#39;s beds are from <a href="https://www.mygrandstrandhealth.com/about-us/newsroom/grand-strand-health-commits-over-350-million-dollars-to-expand-and-meet-regional-growth" style="color:var(--brass);font-weight:600;text-decoration:none" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Grand Strand Health, May 2025</a>. Drive times are our own measurement. We are not medical advisers and this page does not rank or recommend any provider.</p></div></section>
 
