+<script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"How many homes are being built in Myrtle Beach?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Builders were allowed to start 6,511 homes in the Myrtle Beach metro in 2025 and 4,978 from January to September 2026, by the federal permit count. The county's planning office has 44,732 more units approved and not yet built, most of them in Longs, Carolina Forest, Surfside and Burgess."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is Interstate 73 under construction?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"No. The state has bought right of way from I-95 to US 501 and most of the way to SC 22, and has plans. It says funding has not been identified to build any of the three phases. Horry County's $450 million is a match paid only after the state signs a construction contract."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What new hospitals are being built in Myrtle Beach?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"McLeod Health Carolina Forest, 48 beds, is now open. Two more hold state licenses. South Strand Hospital, 59 beds, broke ground in February 2026, and the system has given no opening date. Tidelands Health Carolina Bays, 36 beds at SC 31 and SC 707, is projected for 2028. Five free-standing emergency departments are open or under way."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Which roads are being widened in Myrtle Beach?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"US 501 from SC 31 to SC 544 and the downtown 501 realignment finish in fall 2026. US 701 north of Conway is under construction. The US 17 Bypass is going from four lanes to six between SC 707 and Harrelson Boulevard. SC 90 is in design for 2025 to 2030, and the SC 22 extension is not started."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How current is this page?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The permit count runs to September 2026. The county's development layer was read on November 9, 2026, and its most recent updates are from August 2026. The county's permit map has not been updated since September 22, 2025."}}]}</script>
